stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DECIDE_ROUTE: Behavior annotated, delay computed

    DECIDE_ROUTE --> RUBY_GEN: trigger reason in ruby_reasons[] && ruby_enabled
    DECIDE_ROUTE --> SAPPHIRE_STREAM: else (default)

    RUBY_GEN --> RUBY_HTTP: RubyClient.generate(seed, maxLength, channelId)
    RUBY_HTTP --> RUBY_RESPONSE: HTTP POST :3127/generate → {text}
    RUBY_RESPONSE --> APPLY_TYPO: text received

    SAPPHIRE_STREAM --> SAPPHIRE_HTTP: SapphireClient.askStream(text, sessionId, debug)
    SAPPHIRE_HTTP --> FIRST_CHUNK: SSE data: token
    FIRST_CHUNK --> TYPING_CMD: emit TypingCommand → bot (typing indicator)
    FIRST_CHUNK --> STREAM_TOKENS: continue collecting tokens

    STREAM_TOKENS --> STREAM_TOKENS: SSE token chunks arrive
    STREAM_TOKENS --> FINAL_META: SSE data: {text, debug, label, ...}
    FINAL_META --> APPLY_TYPO: SapphireResult complete

    APPLY_TYPO --> APPLY_SWAP: typo applied if rolled earlier
    APPLY_SWAP --> ASSEMBLE: letter swap applied if rolled earlier

    ASSEMBLE --> BUILD_COMMAND: build RespondCommand
    BUILD_COMMAND --> RESPOND_CMD: RespondCommand{
      responseText,
      delay,
      replyTo,
      replyStyle,
      hesitationWord?,
      burstPlan?,
      typoCorrection?,
      letterSwap?,
      react?,
      voice?,
      debugStats?
    }

    RESPOND_CMD --> SEND_TO_BOT: server.ts → sendCommand(clientId, cmd)
    SEND_TO_BOT --> [*]: Bot executes on platform

    note right of RUBY_GEN: No LLM latency<br/>Instant generation
    note right of SAPPHIRE_STREAM: First token → typing<br/>Then streaming response
